@startuml
title SSAD — Three Connected Models
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "SSAD\nSystem-Structured Analysis Documentation" as SSAD
rectangle "Knowledge Architecture\n\nWHERE knowledge belongs\n\n• perspectives\n• canonical ownership\n• references\n• synthesis" as KA
rectangle "Analysis Workflow\n\nHOW knowledge is built\n\n• evidence\n• boundaries\n• ownership\n• maturity" as AW
rectangle "Change Model\n\nHOW knowledge evolves\n\n• Change Surface\n• impact analysis\n• traceability\n• maintenance" as CM

SSAD --> KA
SSAD --> AW
SSAD --> CM
KA <--> AW : provides structure
AW <--> CM : establishes stable baseline
CM --> KA : updates affected owners
@enduml
